{"meta":{"format_version":"4.5","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"armour_fiend_shoulder_dread","model_identifier":"armour_fiend_shoulder_dread","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## armour_fiend_shoulder_dread\n\nArmour for the Dreadnought, the fiend's iron shoulder plate, sized for him (Patch 7). Worn by `heavy_knight_body` over his harness (`armour_dreadnought_harness`).\n\n- Cubes: 3. Texture 64x64, 1 texel per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -23.0..14.0, y 50.0..71.0, z -9.5..9.5 (37 x 21 x 19 units = 104 x 59 x 53 cm).\n- Source: `fiend` (unchanged): `shoulder_plate` and `shoulder_spike` on its left upper arm and the chest `strap` on its torso. Redrawn at the Dreadnought's size: each face is the fiend's own face, resampled (nearest) to the new size, so the iron, its rivets and the leather strap keep the fiend's colours and pixel style. The fiend's strap has no top or bottom face; here they take the strap's front edge row.\n- Pieces, in heavy_knight_body's bones (same names and rest origins):\n  - `pauldron_l` (-18, 60, 0): `shoulder_plate` x -23..-10, y 62..67, z -7.5..7.5, a slab over the left pauldron's cap that rides on the cap bone so it follows the pauldron in every clip; it covers the cap and the top of the second tier and leaves the second tier's lower edge, the flared outer tier and the lame showing, so the harness's stepped pauldron outline still reads. `shoulder_spike` x -19.5..-16.5, y 67..71 on top of it. Left shoulder only, as on the fiend.\n  - `torso` (0, 42, 0): `chest_strap` x -14..14, y 50..53, z -9.5..9.5, the band round the chest that holds the plate, 0.5 units proud of the cuirass, keel and backplate.\n- No clips of its own; the body's clips move it.\n"},"resolution":{"width":64,"height":64},"elements":[{"name":"shoulder_plate","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-23,62,-7.5],"to":[-10,67,7.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"origin":[-18,60,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0,34,13,39],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[26,19,41,24],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[13,34,26,39],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[41,19,56,24],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0,19,13,34],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[13,19,26,34],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"17d851ec-4379-5f6b-b9dd-a5aec9cd3f5d"},{"name":"shoulder_spike","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-19.5,67,-1.5],"to":[-16.5,71,1.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"origin":[-18,60,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[26,34,29,38],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[29,34,32,38],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[32,34,35,38],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[35,34,38,38],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[38,42,41,45],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[41,42,44,45],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"ef4d6bac-0e45-5ed2-98b8-3ce490fcc693"},{"name":"chest_strap","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-14,50,-9.5],"to":[14,53,9.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"origin":[0,42,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0,39,28,42],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0,42,19,45],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[28,39,56,42],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[19,42,38,45],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0,0,28,19],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[28,0,56,19],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"632e0893-c475-502f-b2a9-d742c36f6e7a"}],"outliner":[{"name":"root","origin":[0,0,0],"color":0,"uuid":"c6658dc3-a429-54db-bdf1-eb43f9db7bb7","export":true,"mirror_uv":false,"isOpen":true,"locked":false,"visibility":true,"autouv":0,"rotation":[0,0,0],"children":[{"name":"hips","origin":[0,37,0],"color":0,"uuid":"922f2a63-6f0f-51b4-a301-d290266e36a0","export":true,"mirror_uv":false,"isOpen":true,"locked":false,"visibility":true,"autouv":0,"rotation":[0,0,0],"children":[{"name":"torso","origin":[0,42,0],"color":0,"uuid":"9d31c63b-baa4-5519-be9f-087a903fdd3f","export":true,"mirror_uv":false,"isOpen":true,"locked":false,"visibility":true,"autouv":0,"rotation":[0,0,0],"children":["632e0893-c475-502f-b2a9-d742c36f6e7a",{"name":"pauldron_l","origin":[-18,60,0],"color":3,"uuid":"bffcf341-8723-53ba-acca-f72e6dd95a65","export":true,"mirror_uv":false,"isOpen":true,"locked":false,"visibility":true,"autouv":0,"rotation":[0,0,0],"children":["17d851ec-4379-5f6b-b9dd-a5aec9cd3f5d","ef4d6bac-0e45-5ed2-98b8-3ce490fcc693"]}]}]}]}],"textures":[{"path":"","name":"armour_fiend_shoulder_dread.png","folder":"","namespace":"","id":"0","width":64,"height":64,"uv_width":64,"uv_height":64,"particle":false,"use_as_default":false,"layers_enabled":false,"sync_to_project":"","render_mode":"default","render_sides":"auto","frame_time":1,"frame_order_type":"loop","frame_order":"","frame_interpolate":false,"visible":true,"internal":true,"saved":true,"uuid":"78ce0e68-63f2-54fa-8037-8fc84f7567f7","relative_path":"","mode":"bitmap","source":"data:image/png;base64,"}],"animations":[],"description":"## armour_fiend_shoulder_dread\n\nArmour, worn by the Dreadnought over his harness (Patch 7 loot).\n\n- Cubes: 3 (0 rotated). Texture 64x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -23.0..14.0, y 50.0..71.0, z -9.5..9.5 (size 37.0 x 21.0 x 19.0 u = 104 x 59 x 53 cm).\nThe fiend's iron shoulder plate (`fiend.bbmodel`, the plate drawn on its torso and upper arm), sized for the Dreadnought and worn over `armour_dreadnought_harness`: the spiked plate on `pauldron_l`, over the harness pauldron's curve, held by a chest strap on `torso`. Patch 7 loot.\n"}